OB','2026-10-25','16:00:00','2026-10-25','16:00:00','UID-BKG-GJ-991204','official_online_booking','https://appointments.uidai.gov.in/','FAILED','2026-10-22 13:40:00','2026-10-25 17:00:00','Citizen missed appointed window at Surat ASK due to transit delay. Official booking lapsed without attendance.');
